---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About LuneAster Travel — a travel designer creating Japan travel guides for independent travelers."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="hero-tag">☽ About</span>
      <h1>Hi, I'm behind LuneAster.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I work as a travel product designer by day. By night, I build the kind of Japan guides
        I wish existed when I first planned my own trips.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2>Why these guides exist</h2>
      <p>
        Most Japan travel content falls into two buckets: influencer vlogs that look beautiful but
        tell you nothing useful, and dense forum threads where the answer is buried on page 47.
      </p>
      <p>
        LuneAster is the middle ground — structured PDFs with exact routes, real prices in yen,
        and practical advice that comes from actually being there.
      </p>

      <h2>My approach</h2>
      <ul class="approach-list">
        <li>
          <strong>I go there.</strong> Every guide is based on first-hand experience, not Reddit scraping.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>I optimize for geography.</strong> Routes minimize backtracking. Hotels are picked
          for walking distance to transit, not for Instagram aesthetics.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>I price everything.</strong> You should know your total trip cost before you book a flight.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No fluff, no ads.</strong> The PDFs are ad-free. I make money from guide sales and
          a few affiliate links — transparently disclosed.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Where to find me</h2>
      <div class="links-list">
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@lune.aster" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok @lune.aster</a>
        <a href="https://luneaster.gumroad.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gumroad Store</a>
        <a href="https://linktr.ee/LuneAster" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Linktree</a>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-box">
        <h3>Questions?</h3>
        <p>Email me at <a href="mailto:luneaster17@gmail.com">luneaster17@gmail.com</a> or DM on TikTok. I read everything.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="disclosure-section">
        <h3>Disclosure</h3>
        <p>Some links on this website are affiliate links.</p>
        <p>I may receive a small commission once you complete bookings through them.</p>
        <p>There is no additional charge for you, and all my travel recommendations remain unbiased.</p>
        <a href="/disclosure" class="disclosure-link">Read full Affiliate Disclosure →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    display: block;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .approach-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .approach-list li {
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
  }

  .approach-list li strong {
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .links-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .links-list a {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--c-text);
    transition: all var(--t-fast);
  }

  .links-list a:hover {
    border-color: var(--c-accent);
    color: var(--c-accent-light);
  }

  .contact-box {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-box h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .disclosure-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--c-surface-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-accent);
  }

  .disclosure-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .disclosure-section p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .disclosure-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
